{"id":"uzh","lemma":"уж","pos":"adv","rank":186,"glosses":["already","Used as a particle to express intensification of emotion, often when admonishing or requesting of someone, including in a few set phrases."],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B6.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B6.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это не так уж плохо.","en":"It's not so bad.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null,{"g":"bad, badly"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"wrong"]]},{"text":"Он не такой уж маленький.","en":"It's not that small.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"like that, like this"},null,{"g":"little, small"}]},{"text":"Я уж думал, ты забыл.","en":"I was starting to think you'd forgotten.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to forget","l":"забыть"}]},{"text":"Для меня это уж слишком сложно.","en":"This is way too hard for me.","words":[{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"too , too much"},{"g":"in a complicated manner"}]},{"text":"Они не такие уж плохие.","en":"They're not so bad.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},null,null,{"g":"bad","l":"плохой"}]}]}